# Button 按钮

**Category**: react
**URL**: http://localhost:3000/cn/docs/react/components/button
**Source**: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/heroui-inc/heroui/refs/heads/v3/apps/docs/content/docs/cn/react/components/(buttons)/button.mdx
> 可点击的按钮组件，支持多种变体与状态。


***

## 引入

```tsx
import { Button } from '@heroui/react';

```

### 用法

```tsx
"use client";

import {Button} from "@heroui/react";

export function Basic() {
  return <Button onPress={() => console.log("按钮已按下")}>点我</Button>;
}

```

